1
00:00:01,900 --> 00:00:08,980
ActAI writes a trading strategy for you from a plain description.

2
00:00:09,080 --> 00:00:12,840
Pick one of the examples, or type your own idea.

3
00:00:12,940 --> 00:00:19,310
Describe what you want in everyday words.

4
00:00:19,410 --> 00:00:29,160
Press Send.

5
00:00:29,260 --> 00:00:34,160
First it shows its plan: the rules and settings it understood.

6
00:00:34,260 --> 00:00:38,670
If it looks right, click Generate strategy.

7
00:00:38,770 --> 00:00:43,680
ActAI writes the code and checks that it compiles.

8
00:00:46,710 --> 00:00:54,140
The finished strategy appears as code, ready to use.

9
00:00:54,240 --> 00:00:58,000
The green tick means it compiled with no errors.

10
00:00:58,100 --> 00:01:01,500
Send to Editor saves it, so you can test or run it.

